window.docContents[189].resolve({"/Basics/#Logical-Foundations--Basics___-Functional-Programming-in-Lean--Proof-by-Rewriting--Proving-properties-about-functions-in-Lean":{"contents":"\n\nWe can prove properties of recursive functions like add:\n\ntheorem add_zero : ∀ n : Nat, n + zero = n := by\n  intro n\n  rfl\ntheorem add_zero : ∀ n : Nat, n + zero = n := by\n  intro n\n  rfl\ntheorem add_zero : ∀ n : Nat, n + zero = n := by\n  intro n\n  rfl\n\n\n#check add_zero\n#check add_zero\n#check add_zero\n\n\nUsing our simplification rule add_zero, we can carry out a simple proof\nabout natural numbers!\n\ntheorem add_zero_zero : ∀ n : Nat, n + zero + zero = n := by\n  intro n\n  rewrite [add_zero]\n  rewrite [add_zero]\n  rfl\ntheorem add_zero_zero : ∀ n : Nat, n + zero + zero = n := by\n  intro n\n  rewrite [add_zero]\n  rewrite [add_zero]\n  rfl\ntheorem add_zero_zero : ∀ n : Nat, n + zero + zero = n := by\n  intro n\n  rewrite [add_zero]\n  rewrite [add_zero]\n  rfl\n\n\nWe'll walk through this proof in the next section.\n\n","context":"Logical Foundations\u0009Basics: Functional Programming in Lean\u0009Proof by Rewriting","header":"1.2.1. Proving properties about functions in Lean","id":"/Basics/#Logical-Foundations--Basics___-Functional-Programming-in-Lean--Proof-by-Rewriting--Proving-properties-about-functions-in-Lean"}});